      "content": "Your advice on using professional affiliations as a \"veneer of normalcy\" is quite astute. It provides exactly the kind of cover required. \n\nHowever, once these connections are established, I will need a way to communicate specific, sensitive directives to these contacts without leaving a trail for the pretenders' intelligence services to follow. Given that my eventual reclamation of the throne will require precise coordination, what methods of \"discreet communication\" would you suggest for a sovereign in hiding? I need something that feels natural to the modern era but remains impenetrable to those who might intercept it.",
